{"seq":3,"slug":"supermassive-black-holes","title":"超大质量黑洞","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/galaxy-astronomy/active-galactic-nuclei/supermassive-black-holes","wordCount":3053,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"超大质量黑洞\">超大质量黑洞</h1><p>超大质量黑洞（Supermassive Black Holes, SMBH）是质量在 10⁶-10¹⁰ 太阳质量范围内的黑洞，几乎存在于每一个大质量星系的中心。它们不仅是 AGN 的能量来源，更通过与宿主星系的共演化关系深刻影响了整个星系的形成与演化历史。从银心 Sgr A* 的 4×10⁶ M☉ 到 TON 618 的 ~7×10¹⁰ M☉，SMBH 的质量跨越了四个数量级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>超大质量黑洞物理围绕三个相互关联的问题展开。<strong>第一个是&quot;多重多少&quot;——质量测量</strong>：不同方法适用于不同条件的目标，动力学方法（恒星运动学、气体运动学、水脉泽盘）适用于近邻星系且精度可达 ±10%，反响映射（利用连续谱与宽线的时延 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 与线宽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>c</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{BH} = f\\,c\\tau\\Delta V^2/G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>）适用于宇宙学距离的 Type 1 AGN，而 EHT 黑洞阴影提供了完全独立的几何约束。理解这些方法的适用范围和系统误差，是读懂任何 SMBH 结论的前提。<strong>第二个是&quot;与星系的关系&quot;——共演化</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mn>4.4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>5.5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{BH} \\propto \\sigma^{4.4-5.5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4.4</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">5.5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的 M-σ 关系及其他黑洞-核球关系成立且散布很小，暗示黑洞增长与星系演化之间存在自调节反馈循环，但具体机制（AGN 反馈、并合驱动还是统计收敛）仍有争议。<strong>第三个是&quot;从哪来、怎么长&quot;——增长历史</strong>：Soltan 论证把 AGN 辐射总量与今天的本地黑洞质量密度联系起来，证实 SMBH 主要通过辐射高效吸积增长；而高红移巨型黑洞的存在引出了&quot;黑洞种子问题&quot;，即轻种子、重种子还是极重种子。</p>\n<p>这三个问题层层递进：能称重才能发现关系，发现关系才能追问共同增长的历史，而增长历史又反过来约束了种子模型与反馈机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超大质量黑洞的质量测量\">超大质量黑洞的质量测量</h2><p>精确测量 SMBH 质量是理解黑洞物理和星系演化的基础。不同方法适用于不同条件的目标：</p>\n<h3 id=\"动力学方法\">动力学方法</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>适用条件</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>代表结果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>恒星运动学</td>\n<td>近邻星系（&lt;100 Mpc）</td>\n<td>±20-30%</td>\n<td>Sgr A*: 4×10⁶ M☉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>气体运动学（光学/分子）</td>\n<td>规则旋转气体盘</td>\n<td>±30%</td>\n<td>M87: 6.5×10⁹ M☉（EHT）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>水脉泽盘运动学</td>\n<td>边缘视角活跃核</td>\n<td>±10%（最精确）</td>\n<td>NGC 4258: 3.8×10⁷ M☉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>反响映射</td>\n<td>Type 1 AGN</td>\n<td>±30-50%</td>\n<td>适用于宇宙学距离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单历元振动光度法</td>\n<td>高红移类星体</td>\n<td>±0.4 dex</td>\n<td>大样本统计</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"反响映射-reverberation-mapping\">反响映射（Reverberation Mapping）</h3><p>反响映射是测量遥远 AGN 黑洞质量的最重要方法：</p>\n<p><strong>原理</strong>：AGN 连续谱（来自吸积盘）变化后，BLR 发射线以时延 τ 响应——该时延即为 BLR 的光行时距离。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>τ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mi>G</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{BH} = f \\cdot \\frac{c\\tau \\cdot \\Delta V^2}{G}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 τ 为 BLR 时延，ΔV 为线宽（FWHM 或速度弥散），f 为依赖 BLR 几何和运动学的因子（~1-5）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>不确定度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时延 τ</td>\n<td>连续谱-发射线互相关</td>\n<td>±10-30%（好数据）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线宽 ΔV</td>\n<td>变线轮廓均方根（rms）谱</td>\n<td>±20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>形状因子 f</td>\n<td>校准到 M-σ 关系</td>\n<td>系统 ~0.3 dex</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>已有约 100 个 AGN 获得了可靠的反响映射黑洞质量，建立了 BLR 尺度-光度关系（R-L relation）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∝</mo><msubsup><mi>L</mi><mn>5100</mn><mn>0.5</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{BLR} \\propto L^{0.5}_{5100}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1111em;vertical-align:-0.247em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5100</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这一关系使得仅需单历元光谱即可估算黑洞质量（Single-Epoch Method），已被应用于数十万个 SDSS 类星体。</p>\n<h3 id=\"黑洞阴影\">黑洞阴影</h3><p>EHT 通过直接成像黑洞阴影获得质量的独立约束：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>阴影尺寸</th>\n<th>推导质量</th>\n<th>与动力学质量一致性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>M87*</td>\n<td>42 ± 3 μas</td>\n<td>(6.5 ± 0.7)×10⁹ M☉</td>\n<td>与恒星动力学一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sgr A*</td>\n<td>51.8 ± 2.3 μas</td>\n<td>~4×10⁶ M☉</td>\n<td>与 S2 轨道一致</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"黑洞-宿主星系共演化关系\">黑洞-宿主星系共演化关系</h2><p>1990 年代末至 2000 年代初发现的 SMBH 质量与宿主星系整体性质之间的紧密相关，是现代星系物理学最重要的发现之一：</p>\n<h3 id=\"m-关系\">M-σ 关系</h3><p>黑洞质量与宿主星系核球恒星速度弥散的幂律关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mi>α</mi></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>α</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>4.4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>5.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{BH} \\propto \\sigma^{\\alpha}, \\quad \\alpha \\approx 4.4-5.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9088em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4.4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5.5</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>最新估计</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>斜率 α</td>\n<td>~4.4-5.5（样本依赖）</td>\n<td>Kormendy &amp; Ho 2013, Saglia+2016</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本征散布</td>\n<td>~0.3-0.4 dex</td>\n<td>测量误差扣除后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用范围</td>\n<td>σ ~ 70-400 km/s</td>\n<td>经典核球为主</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"其他共演化关系\">其他共演化关系</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>关系</th>\n<th>形式</th>\n<th>散布</th>\n<th>物理联系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>M_BH - M_bulge</td>\n<td>M_BH ≈ 0.002 M_bulge</td>\n<td>~0.3 dex</td>\n<td>核球质量比例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>M_BH - L_bulge</td>\n<td>M_BH ∝ L^1.1</td>\n<td>~0.4 dex</td>\n<td>光度代替质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>M_BH - M_halo</td>\n<td>较散（间接）</td>\n<td>&gt;0.5 dex</td>\n<td>通过核球间接关联</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>M_BH - n_Sérsic</td>\n<td>正相关</td>\n<td>~0.4 dex</td>\n<td>核球集中度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 黑洞-星系共演化的物理机制&#10;        A[气体吸积 黑洞增长] --&gt; B[AGN反馈 能量注入]&#10;        B --&gt; C[抑制冷却和恒星形成]&#10;        C --&gt; D[星系增长停滞]&#10;        D --&gt; E[建立M_BH-σ关系]&#10;        F[星系并合] --&gt; A&#10;        F --&gt; G[核球增长]&#10;        G --&gt; E&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 黑洞-星系共演化的物理机制\n        A[气体吸积 黑洞增长] --&gt; B[AGN反馈 能量注入]\n        B --&gt; C[抑制冷却和恒星形成]\n        C --&gt; D[星系增长停滞]\n        D --&gt; E[建立M_BH-σ关系]\n        F[星系并合] --&gt; A\n        F --&gt; G[核球增长]\n        G --&gt; E\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"共演化的物理解释\">共演化的物理解释</h3><p>这些关系暗示黑洞增长与星系演化之间存在自调节反馈循环，但具体机制仍有争议：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>假说</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>预测</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AGN 反馈调节</td>\n<td>黑洞增长到阈值时产生反馈，终止黑洞和星系共同的气体供给</td>\n<td>自然产生 M-σ 斜率 ~4-5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并合驱动</td>\n<td>并合同时输送气体给黑洞和触发星暴</td>\n<td>相关源于共同触发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>统计收敛（中心极限定理）</td>\n<td>多次随机并合的统计结果</td>\n<td>散布随并合次数减小</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"超大质量黑洞的增长历史\">超大质量黑洞的增长历史</h2><h3 id=\"宇宙黑洞吸积率密度\">宇宙黑洞吸积率密度</h3><p>AGN 光度函数的积分给出了宇宙中 SMBH 的平均吸积率密度随红移的演化：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>红移范围</th>\n<th>吸积率密度峰值</th>\n<th>主导 AGN 类型</th>\n<th>占总增长比例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>z ~ 0-0.5</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>Seyfert, LINER</td>\n<td>~10%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>z ~ 0.5-1</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>Seyfert, 低光度 QSO</td>\n<td>~20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>z ~ 1-3</td>\n<td>峰值</td>\n<td>QSO</td>\n<td>~50%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>z ~ 3-6</td>\n<td>下降</td>\n<td>高光度 QSO</td>\n<td>~15%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>z &gt; 6</td>\n<td>极低（但已有巨型 BH）</td>\n<td>稀有高红移 QSO</td>\n<td>~5%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"soltan-论证\">Soltan 论证</h3><p>Soltan（1982）提出的经典论证将 AGN 辐射总量与今天本地 SMBH 质量密度联系起来：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ρ</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>L</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>L</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\rho_{BH}(z=0) = \\frac{(1-\\epsilon)}{\\epsilon c^2} \\int_0^\\infty \\Phi(L,z) L \\, dL \\, dt</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ρ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.339em;vertical-align:-0.9119em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4143em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8129em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∞</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9119em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Φ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>观测到的 AGN 辐射总量预测的本地黑洞质量密度（~4×10⁵ M☉/Mpc³）与直接动力学测量一致，证实：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>SMBH 质量主要通过辐射高效吸积（η ~ 0.1）累积</li>\n<li>大部分增长发生在明亮 AGN 相（非暗吸积）</li>\n<li>辐射总量与本地质量密度的一致，同时约束了吸积辐射效率与宇宙 AGN 光度函数</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"黑洞种子问题\">黑洞种子问题</h3><p>宇宙第一代 SMBH 如何在大爆炸后不到 10 亿年内达到 10⁹ M☉ 仍是未解难题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>种子模型</th>\n<th>初始质量</th>\n<th>形成机制</th>\n<th>挑战</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pop III 恒星残骸</td>\n<td>~100-300 M☉</td>\n<td>第一代大质量恒星坍缩</td>\n<td>需持续超爱丁顿吸积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>直接坍缩黑洞（DCBH）</td>\n<td>~10⁴-10⁵ M☉</td>\n<td>原始气体云直接坍缩（无 H₂ 冷却）</td>\n<td>需特殊环境条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>致密星团跑道坍缩</td>\n<td>~10³-10⁴ M☉</td>\n<td>星团中恒星碰撞并合</td>\n<td>动力学约束严格</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原初黑洞（PBH）</td>\n<td>变化大</td>\n<td>宇宙早期密度涨落</td>\n<td>缺乏观测证据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>JWST 在高红移发现的低光度 AGN 候选体（如 z~10 的 UHZ1）可能为&quot;重种子&quot;模型提供了观测支持。</p>\n<h2 id=\"黑洞自旋测量\">黑洞自旋测量</h2><p>黑洞自旋（Spin, a = J/Mc²/R_g，0 ≤ a ≤ 0.998）是描述 Kerr 黑洞的第二个参数（仅次于质量），对喷流产生效率、辐射效率和引力波特征都有重要影响。</p>\n<h3 id=\"测量方法\">测量方法</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>当前约束</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>X 射线铁线轮廓</td>\n<td>相对论展宽 → ISCO 半径 → 自旋</td>\n<td>~30 个 AGN 有约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连续谱拟合</td>\n<td>吸积盘辐射效率 → 自旋</td>\n<td>主要用于恒星级 BH</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>X 射线反射光谱</td>\n<td>反射连续谱 + 铁线联合拟合</td>\n<td>最广泛使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EHT 阴影</td>\n<td>阴影形状和喷流方向</td>\n<td>M87*: a ~ 0.9（模型依赖）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引力波（未来）</td>\n<td>环下振荡模式</td>\n<td>LISA 时代</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>已测量自旋的 AGN 样本显示：许多高光度 AGN 的自旋偏高（a &gt; 0.7），支持高效 BZ 喷流产生机制和高辐射效率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"双超大质量黑洞\">双超大质量黑洞</h2><p>星系并合必然产生双超大质量黑洞系统。不同演化阶段的双黑洞具有不同的观测特征：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分离尺度</th>\n<th>观测方法</th>\n<th>已确认例子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&gt;1 kpc</td>\n<td>双 AGN 直接分辨</td>\n<td>NGC 6240, Mrk 463</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10 pc - 1 kpc</td>\n<td>双窄线峰/X射线</td>\n<td>~30 个候选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&lt;10 pc</td>\n<td>周期性光变/径向速度</td>\n<td>OJ 287（争议）, PG 1302-102</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>~mpc</td>\n<td>PTA 引力波</td>\n<td>随机背景已探测（2023）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2023 年多个脉冲星计时阵列同时报告纳赫兹引力波背景信号，虽然单个源尚未被分辨，但这一信号的最自然解释是数千对正在靠近的超大质量黑洞双星系统的引力波叠加。</p>\n<h2 id=\"中等质量黑洞-imbh\">中等质量黑洞（IMBH）</h2><p>质量在 10²-10⁵ M☉ 范围的中等质量黑洞是连接恒星级黑洞和超大质量黑洞的&quot;缺失环节&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>候选类型</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n<th>证据强度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>矮星系核中的低质量 AGN</td>\n<td>NGC 4395（M~10⁴ M☉）</td>\n<td>强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超亮 X 射线源（ULX）</td>\n<td>HLX-1（ESO 243-49）</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>球状星团中心</td>\n<td>ω Centauri, 47 Tuc</td>\n<td>争议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>引力波并合产物</td>\n<td>GW190521（142 M☉）</td>\n<td>确认（恒星级到中等过渡）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高速分子云伴侣</td>\n<td>银心候选体</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>JWST 和 Euclid 在矮星系中搜索低质量 AGN 有望在未来数年大幅增加 IMBH 的样本量。LISA 空间引力波探测器将直接探测 IMBH 并合事件的引力波信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"黑洞质量函数与人口统计\">黑洞质量函数与人口统计</h2><p>本地宇宙中 SMBH 的质量函数已通过 M-σ 关系和星系速度弥散函数推导：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>质量范围</th>\n<th>数密度（Mpc⁻³ dex⁻¹）</th>\n<th>主导宿主类型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>10⁶-10⁷ M☉</td>\n<td>~10⁻²</td>\n<td>矮星系、晚型旋涡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10⁷-10⁸ M☉</td>\n<td>~10⁻³</td>\n<td>中等旋涡（银河系级）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10⁸-10⁹ M☉</td>\n<td>~10⁻⁴</td>\n<td>早型旋涡、椭圆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10⁹-10¹⁰ M☉</td>\n<td>~10⁻⁵-10⁻⁶</td>\n<td>大质量椭圆、BCG</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt;10¹⁰ M☉</td>\n<td>&lt;10⁻⁷</td>\n<td>极稀有</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"未来展望\">未来展望</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设施/项目</th>\n<th>时间线</th>\n<th>对 SMBH 研究的贡献</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ngEHT</td>\n<td>2030s</td>\n<td>黑洞阴影动态影像、自旋精确测量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LISA</td>\n<td>2037 发射</td>\n<td>SMBH 并合引力波、EMRI 精确质量/自旋</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Athena X-ray</td>\n<td>2030s</td>\n<td>大样本反响映射、高红移 AGN</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>JWST（持续）</td>\n<td>当前-2040s</td>\n<td>高红移种子黑洞、矮星系 IMBH</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rubin/LSST</td>\n<td>2025-2035</td>\n<td>大规模时域巡天 → 反响映射工厂</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SKA</td>\n<td>2030s</td>\n<td>PTA 单源探测、射电 AGN 普查</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>超大质量黑洞研究正在进入多信使时代：电磁波（从射电到 γ 射线）、引力波（PTA 和未来 LISA）、以及可能的高能中微子，将共同揭示这些宇宙巨兽的完整物理图景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>超大质量黑洞质量跨越 10⁶-10¹⁰ M☉ 四个数量级；质量测量的方法按适用条件分层——动力学方法（恒星/气体/水脉泽）适用于近邻星系且精度高，反响映射（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>c</mi><mi>τ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msup><mi>V</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{BH}=f\\,c\\tau\\Delta V^2/G</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span></span></span></span></span>，配合 R-L 关系）适用于宇宙学距离，EHT 阴影提供独立几何约束。</li>\n<li>M-σ 关系（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∝</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mn>4.4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>5.5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{BH} \\propto \\sigma^{4.4-5.5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4.4</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">5.5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，散布 ~0.3-0.4 dex）及其他黑洞-核球关系表明黑洞与星系共演化，可能机制包括 AGN 反馈调节、并合驱动和统计收敛。</li>\n<li>Soltan 论证把 AGN 辐射总量与本地黑洞质量密度联系起来，证实现今 SMBH 主要通过辐射高效吸积（η ~ 0.1）增长，大部分增长发生在 z ~ 1-3 的明亮 AGN 相。</li>\n<li>&quot;黑洞种子问题&quot;——如何在宇宙不足 10 亿年内长到 10⁹ M☉——的候选模型有 Pop III 残骸（轻种子）、直接坍缩黑洞（重种子）和致密星团跑道坍缩，JWST 在 z~10 发现的 UHZ1 可能支持重种子模型。</li>\n<li>自旋（0 ≤ a ≤ 0.998）是 Kerr 黑洞的第二参数，影响喷流效率（Blandford-Znajek）和辐射效率；X 射线铁线轮廓与反射光谱是主要测量手段。</li>\n<li>星系并合产生双超大质量黑洞，从 kpc 演化到并合需跨越&quot;最终秒差距问题&quot;；2023 年 PTA 探测到的纳赫兹引力波背景的最自然解释是数千对双黑洞的引力波叠加。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"超大质量黑洞","id":"超大质量黑洞"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"超大质量黑洞的质量测量","id":"超大质量黑洞的质量测量"},{"level":3,"text":"动力学方法","id":"动力学方法"},{"level":3,"text":"反响映射（Reverberation Mapping）","id":"反响映射-reverberation-mapping"},{"level":3,"text":"黑洞阴影","id":"黑洞阴影"},{"level":2,"text":"黑洞-宿主星系共演化关系","id":"黑洞-宿主星系共演化关系"},{"level":3,"text":"M-σ 关系","id":"m-关系"},{"level":3,"text":"其他共演化关系","id":"其他共演化关系"},{"level":3,"text":"共演化的物理解释","id":"共演化的物理解释"},{"level":2,"text":"超大质量黑洞的增长历史","id":"超大质量黑洞的增长历史"},{"level":3,"text":"宇宙黑洞吸积率密度","id":"宇宙黑洞吸积率密度"},{"level":3,"text":"Soltan 论证","id":"soltan-论证"},{"level":3,"text":"黑洞种子问题","id":"黑洞种子问题"},{"level":2,"text":"黑洞自旋测量","id":"黑洞自旋测量"},{"level":3,"text":"测量方法","id":"测量方法"},{"level":2,"text":"双超大质量黑洞","id":"双超大质量黑洞"},{"level":2,"text":"中等质量黑洞（IMBH）","id":"中等质量黑洞-imbh"},{"level":2,"text":"黑洞质量函数与人口统计","id":"黑洞质量函数与人口统计"},{"level":2,"text":"未来展望","id":"未来展望"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"类星体与耀变体","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/galaxy-astronomy/active-galactic-nuclei/quasars-blazars"},"next":{"title":"星系团","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/galaxy-astronomy/large-scale-structure/galaxy-clusters"}}